        "id": "C",
        "text": "2 atm",
        "image": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "5 atm",
        "image": ""
      }
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "A",
    "explanation": "Explanation: Pf = (P1V1 + P2V2 + P3V3) / Vf = (2*2 + 4*3 + 3*4) / (2+3+4) = (4 + 12 + 12) / 9 = 28 / 9 = 3.11 atm. The nearest integer is 3 atm. Option A.",
